<title>USA: TABLE-Pohang Iron &amp; Steel sells notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Pohang Iron &amp; Steel sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Pohang Iron &amp; Steel Co Ltd was priced Thursday, according to lead manager JP Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Pohang Iron &amp; Steel Co is a South Korean steel company.</p>
<p>BORROWER POHANG IRON &amp; STEEL CO LTD</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.745  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.172 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD +92 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
